<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop says outlook positive.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop says outlook positive.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French metals group Metaleurop said on Monday the company's outlook was positive, following rationalisation programmes undertaken in the 1995/96 year.</p>
<p>&quot;The outlook for Metaleurop is positive,&quot; the company said in a statement with 1995/96 results. &quot;The rationalisation programme implemented all over the group will bring additional and significant cost reductions and will further lower the break-even points in Metaleurop's main activities.&quot;</p>
<p>It added that zinc has &quot;upward potential&quot; for the first time in several years.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 pnt</p>
